      "message": "This feels like a discussion that would best be had on one or more Android feature requests (https://issuetracker.google.com/Android/ for external parties I believe), particularly if you have data, suggestions, or API requests.\n\nYou clearly have knowledge, have given this thought and have insights that would be valuable for me to understand. I\u0027ll try to respond if I can if you let me know the links here.\n\nWhen you create issues / feature requests, if you can express how Android is not meeting your needs right now then I can understand if they align with what we\u0027re trying to provide in the Stock Android platform.",
